Huafu NFC artifact provides NFC reading and writing, NFC copying functions. You can use this product to read NFC tags or write the created text data to the tags. It also has practical functions such as fuel calculation and image compression.

Subscribe:
1. Users can only use NFC read and write, NFC copy, fuel calculation, and other functions infinitely after paying a subscription;
2. The subscription fee will be deducted from the iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase, and can be automatically renewed for a renewal fee of $9.99 /year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

